ion":""}]},{"id":"P034-S2-Q17","number":17,"question":"24.04.28 한국남부발전 (사람인) · 객관식 42번","searchText":" 42\n\n다음 내용의 빈칸에 알맞은 것은?\n\n\n 이상적인 트랜스 컨덕턴스 증폭기의 입력 임피던스는\n\n   ( ㉠  )Ω이고, 출력 임피던스는 ( ㉡  )Ω이다.\n\n\n        ㉠           ㉡\n\n ①      ∞          ∞\n\n ②      ∞                     \n\n ③                        ∞\n\n ④                                   ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.04.28 한국남부발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e13-m42","number":42},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e13-m42-q.webp","width":696,"height":485},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e13-m42-e1.webp","width":678,"height":479}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P034-S2-Q18","number":18,"question":"24.04.28 한국남부발전 (사람인) · 객관식 43번","searchText":" 43\n\n4bit 래더저항(R-2R) DAC의 아날로그 출력전압의 범위는\n\n0~15V이다. 4bit입력이 1010인 경우의 아날로그 출력\n\n전압V은?\n\n\n① 3           ② 5\n\n③ 10          ④ 12","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.04.28 한국남부발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e13-m43","number":43},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e13-m43-q.webp","width":678,"height":523},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e13-m43-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1403}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P034-S2-Q19","number":19,"question":"24.04.28 한국남부발전 (사람인) · 객관식 44번","searchText":" 44\n\n다음은 아날로그 전압이 입력으로 가해지면 출력으로\n\n디지털 전압이 나타나는 A/D변환기 회로이다.\n\n이 회로에서 ㉠에 필요한 장치는?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 비교기        ② 연산기\n\n③ 카운터        ④ 가산기","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.04.28 한국남부발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e13-m44","number":44},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e13-m44-q.webp","width":678,"height":853},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e13-m44-e1.webp","width":696,"height":348}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P034-S2-Q20","number":20,"question":"24.04.28 한국남부발전 (사람인) · 객관식 45번","searchText":" 45\n\n다이오드 직선 검파회로에서 진폭 V인 피변조파가\n\n인가되었을 때, 부하저항에 나타내는 출력 변조파 전압의\n\n실횻값V은?\n\n(단, 변조도는 50, 검파효율은 80이다.)\n\n①           ② \n③           ④ ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.04.28 한국남부발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e13-m45","number":45},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e13-m45-q.webp","width":678,"height":507},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e13-m45-e1.webp","width":696,"height":659}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P034-S2-Q21","number":21,"question":"24.04.28 한국남부발전 (사람인) · 객관식 46번","searchText":" 46\n\n다음의 회로에서 1V인 경우의 출력전압V는?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 2.0          ② 2.5\n\n③ 3.0          ④ 3.5","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.04.28 한국남부발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e13-m46","number":46},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e13-m46-q.webp","width":696,"height":778},"explanationIm